"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T11:03:12Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T11:03:12Z","body":"I might be missing something obvious here, but is `disable_physics_3d` somehow implied by `disable_3d`?\r\n\r\nIf not, won't this mean that anyone currently relying on `disable_3d` will start to include the 3D physics server modules in their build, in a mostly silent manner?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2690358564/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2690584085","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103373#issuecomment-2690584085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103373","id":2690584085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gXw4V","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T12:54:53Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T12:54:53Z","body":"@mihe Disabling 3D will also disable 3D physics. You can see the code triggering that here:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103373/files#diff-d78c5c377c03dd251edc72cdb0ae7d9986fa08361eb392187218f8c670c0bc4eR995-R1001","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2690584085/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2760473572","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103373#issuecomment-2760473572","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103373","id":2760473572,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kiXvk","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-28T07:52:02Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T07:52:02Z","body":"I pushed some minor tweaks, this should be ready to go.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2760473572/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2761383268","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103373#issuecomment-2761383268","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103373","id":2761383268,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kl11k","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-28T13:34:10Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T13:34:10Z","body":"I just re-tested locally and it seems `disable_physics_2d` fails building, probably due to 4765bc883c297836372b09c56a2789845583186a.\r\n\r\n```\r\nIn file included from scene/2d/scu/scu_scene_2d.gen.cpp:31:\r\n./scene/2d/tile_map_layer.cpp: In member function 'void TileMapLayer::_debug_update(bool)':\r\n./scene/2d/tile_map_layer.cpp:139:17: error: '_physics_draw_quadrant_debug' was not declared in this scope\r\n  139 |                 _physics_draw_quadrant_debug(ci, *debug_quadrant.ptr());\r\n      |                 ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis shows the need to add those options to a CI build so we can make sure we don't break them.\r\n\r\nI suggest adding this in this PR:\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/.github/workflows/linux_builds.yml b/.github/workflows/linux_builds.yml\r\nindex 6305db26e2..39f4f0b67e 100644\r\n--- a/.github/workflows/linux_builds.yml\r\n+++ b/.github/workflows/linux_builds.yml\r\n@@ -90,7 +90,7 @@ jobs:\r\n           - name: Minimal template (target=template_release, tests=yes, everything disabled)\r\n             cache-name: linux-template-minimal\r\n             target: template_release\r\n-            sconsflags: modules_enabled_by_default=no disable_3d=yes disable_advanced_gui=yes deprecated=no minizip=no\r\n+            sconsflags: modules_enabled_by_default=no disable_3d=yes disable_advanced_gui=yes disable_physics_2d=yes disable_physics_3d=yes deprecated=no minizip=no\r\n             bin: ./bin/godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64\r\n             tests: true\r\n             artifact: true\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2761383268/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2761880459","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103373#issuecomment-2761880459","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103373","id":2761880459,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6knvOL","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-28T16:37:00Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T16:37:00Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2761880459/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2762985533","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103373#issuecomment-2762985533","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103373","id":2762985533,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kr9A9","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-29T01:34:13Z","updated_at":"2025-03-29T04:38:51Z","body":"Disabling the 2D physics server is a subset of disabling 2D nodes, which this PR does: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/47054\r\n\r\nI'll refactor my PR so that disabling 2D will also define `PHYSICS_2D_DISABLED` so that this define handles both cases, which will substantially reduce the diffs, hooray :)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2762985533/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3087291370","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103373#issuecomment-3087291370","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103373","id":3087291370,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64BFPq","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-18T06:38:30Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T06:44:25Z","body":"Was it intentional to disable `scene/3d/spring_bone_collision_*` when compiling with `PHYSICS_3D_DISABLED`? These aren't actually a part of physics, so they *could* be enabled, but arguably those who don't want physics also don't want these. I can see it either way, but I wanted to ask about it.\r\n\r\nIf these classes are desired when 3D physics is disabled, we can re-enable them.\r\n\r\nIf these classes aren't desired when 3D physics is disabled, we may want to make this explicit by moving them to the physics folder, but it could also be argued that they're better where they are now. Note that on the editor side, PR #108523 moved `spring_bone_3d_gizmo_plugin.h` in to the `physics` folder.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3087291370/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]